      "details": "\r\n<p>Tripi is suggested to be the closest modern place to the ancient settlement of Abakainon by both Manni (1981) and the BTCGI. The <em>Barrington Atlas</em> refers, more specifically, to the area of Casale di Tripi.</p>\r\n",
      "review_state": "published",
      "description": "Name of the modern city in Sicily that is thought to be in the area of the ancient settlement of Abakainon.",
